{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_dotfiles", "label": "dotfiles (README principal)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L1-L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_dos_caminos_excluyentes", "label": "Nix y setup.py son alternativas excluyentes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L10-L14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los dos caminos quieren ser duenos de ~/.config, y home-manager se niega a pisar un symlink que no creo el. No son capas: hay que elegir uno, y `setup.py --unlink` es el paso previo para migrar a home-manager."}, {"id": "readme_instalacion_nix", "label": "Instalacion con Nix (.#ruben)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L16-L29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Instala con las versiones exactas de flake.lock para que otra maquina reciba lo mismo y no lo que traiga la distro esa semana."}, {"id": "readme_instalacion_distro", "label": "Instalacion con paquetes de la distro (install.sh / setup.py)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L40-L61", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Solo --install modifica el sistema y pregunta antes de anadir un repositorio de terceros; setup.py es idempotente, nunca borra, y --unlink solo quita symlinks que apunten a este checkout."}, {"id": "readme_nvim_repositorio_aparte", "label": "Config de neovim en repositorio propio", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L6-L8", "source_url": "https://github.com/myticalruben/nvim", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Es lo unico del repositorio que tiene sentido instalar suelto, asi que se saco a su propio flake; el flake de estos dotfiles lo trae como input y sigue llegando con el mismo switch."}, {"id": "readme_atajos_teclado", "label": "Atajos de teclado (MOD = Super)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L63-L149", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_apagado_sin_atajo", "label": "Apagar y reiniciar solo desde wlogout", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L122-L136", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MOD+Q cierra la ventana, asi que MOD+Shift+Q significaba que un Shift de mas apagaba el equipo sin preguntar. Los botones de wlogout van de menos a mas destructivo para que un Enter que se escape bloquee la pantalla en vez de apagar."}, {"id": "readme_ajustes_por_maquina", "label": "Ajustes por maquina (hypr/modules/local.lua)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L151-L165", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Todo lo dependiente de una maquina concreta (conectores, resoluciones, escala, fondo, escritorios fijados) se concentra en un unico archivo ignorado por git que se carga el ultimo y sobrescribe los valores compartidos."}, {"id": "readme_autodeteccion", "label": "Lo que se detecta solo (monitores, bateria, navegador, ImageMagick, PATH)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L167-L184", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un ajuste que hay que recordar poner en cada maquina es un ajuste que algun dia no esta puesto, asi que solo local.lua guarda lo indeducible. La bateria es el caso claro: el modulo battery de waybar avisaba 'No batteries.' en el PC de mesa y dejaba un hueco; battery.sh mira /sys/class/power_supply y no imprime nada, con lo que waybar oculta el modulo entero. Esto permite el mismo commit en portatil y sobremesa sin una rama por maquina."}, {"id": "readme_comprobaciones", "label": "Comprobaciones locales y en CI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L206-L224", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "tools/check-config.py valida que exista lo que las configs se citan entre si (scripts, iconos de wlogout contra layout y CSS, modulos de waybar colocados contra configurados, @imports de rofi y las rutas que enlaza setup.py) porque nada de eso falla con un error visible."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_comprobaciones", "target": "_github_workflows_check_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L220-L221", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_comprobaciones", "target": "_github_workflows_check_referencias", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L213-L218", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_dotfiles", "target": "readme_instalacion_nix", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L16-L29", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_dotfiles", "target": "readme_instalacion_distro", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L40-L61", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_dos_caminos_excluyentes", "target": "readme_instalacion_nix", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L10-L14", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_dos_caminos_excluyentes", "target": "readme_instalacion_distro", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L10-L14", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_instalacion_nix", "target": "nix_readme_home_manager", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_instalacion_nix", "target": "nix_readme_compositor_desde_distro", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L27-L29", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_dotfiles", "target": "nix_setup_readme_bootstrap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L31-L38", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_dotfiles", "target": "readme_nvim_repositorio_aparte", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L6-L8", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_dotfiles", "target": "readme_atajos_teclado", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L63-L66", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_apagado_sin_atajo", "target": "readme_atajos_teclado", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L122-L136", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_dotfiles", "target": "readme_ajustes_por_maquina", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L151-L162", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_autodeteccion", "target": "readme_ajustes_por_maquina", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L167-L171", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_autodeteccion", "target": "nix_readme_session_path", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L179", "weight": 1.0}, 